# `lrcc init` copies the protocol template byte for byte into every new review, and prints the
# copy's SHA-256 (ADR-0010). A checkout that rewrote its line endings would give the same version
# of LRCC a different digest on Windows than on Linux: a fresh Windows clone was measured with a
# CR on every one of its 55 lines. Git must keep it LF everywhere.
src/lrcc/features/init/protocol-template.yaml text eol=lf
